 Editable->False,ExpressionUUID->"89528abf-594b-4180-a7d1-f1458e34dc9d"],

Cell["\<\
The factor 3 in the squared mixed operator belongs to the four-dimensional \
specialization. Keep dimension-dependent coefficients if adapting these \
checks to general D.\
\>", "Text",
 Editable->False,ExpressionUUID->"4196486c-3954-41a7-b1ba-49377534ddfb"],

